  "solution": {
    "text": "Hint : At terminal speed.\r\n$\\mathrm{V}_{\\mathrm{T}}=\\frac{2 \\mathrm{r}^{2}}{9 \\eta}\\left(\\rho_{\\mathrm{s}}-\\rho_{\\mathrm{L}}\\right) \\mathrm{g} \\quad$ (Assuming other factor constant)\r\nSo, $\\mathrm{V}_{\\mathrm{T}} \\propto \\frac{1}{\\eta}$ (rectangular hyperbola)",
